    },
    {
      "tick": 121,
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "Yes, the steak is cooked now and still in the upper pan. Reset the rice plate at the trash, then rebuild tortilla first, cooked rice second, steak third. Keep an eye on that pan while you redo the rice.",
