    },
    {
      "tick": 135,
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "The pan with the steak is smoking now—it's been left done on the heat. Dump the rice plate now and rebuild promptly: tortilla, fresh cooked rice, then scoop the steak before it burns. Leave the vegetables until the steak is off the heat.",
